  [*] --> SDD_ST_11_Draft
  SDD_ST_11_Draft --> SDD_ST_11_Draft : Expert saves draft
  SDD_ST_11_Draft --> SDD_ST_11_Submitted : Expert submits valid module + content
  SDD_ST_11_Submitted --> SDD_ST_11_Returned : L and D returns with feedback
  SDD_ST_11_Returned --> SDD_ST_11_Draft : Expert revises
  SDD_ST_11_Returned --> SDD_ST_11_Submitted : Expert resubmits valid content
  SDD_ST_11_Submitted --> SDD_ST_11_PublishPending : L and D approves exact revision
  SDD_ST_11_PublishPending --> SDD_ST_11_PublishPending : publication failure / retry
  SDD_ST_11_PublishPending --> SDD_ST_11_Released : catalog publication succeeds
  SDD_ST_11_Released --> SDD_ST_11_Draft : author successor, preserve released version

  SDD_ST_11_Draft --> [*] : Expert deletes eligible draft
  SDD_ST_11_Released --> SDD_ST_11_ArchiveRequested : Expert requests archive
  SDD_ST_11_ArchiveRequested --> SDD_ST_11_Released : L and D returns request with reason
  SDD_ST_11_ArchiveRequested --> SDD_ST_11_ArchivePending : L and D approves, coverage retained
  SDD_ST_11_ArchivePending --> SDD_ST_11_ArchivePending : projection failure / retry
  SDD_ST_11_ArchivePending --> SDD_ST_11_Archived : catalog archive succeeds
  SDD_ST_11_Archived --> SDD_ST_11_Draft : Expert restores, approval required

